%% Step reveals, gaps, and slide transitions. Set the transition once on the deck
%% (across: none|fade|slide|push, step: none|fade|rise); a master/theme can carry
%% a default that this overrides.
%%   lmr2svg examples/transitions/deck.lmr -o transitions.html
!title Transitions and reveals
!transition slide rise

!slide Step reveals

Bullets appear one step at a time:

+ first
+ second
+ third

!slide Spacing with gaps

Top line.

!gap[fill]

`!gap[fill]` grows to push this line to the bottom of the region.

!slide[.center .middle] A closing slide

!slide[.center .middle] uses variant modifiers to centre and vertically middle
the content.
